          "Domestic Tourism: Ghanaian citizens and residents traveling within the borders of Ghana (e.g., an Accra family vacationing at Kakum National Park).",
          "Regional Tourism: Cross-border travel within the West African ECOWAS sub-region (e.g., visitors from Nigeria, Togo, or Côte d'Ivoire attending conferences or festivals in Ghana).",
          "International Tourism: Travelers arriving from foreign continents (North America, Europe, Asia) for leisure, research, or heritage pilgrimage.",
          "Eco-Tourism: Responsible travel to natural ecological areas that conserves the environment, respects wildlife, and sustains the well-being of the local community."
