        "keyTakeaway": "Tourism encompasses domestic, regional, and international travel, including ecotourism that conserves pristine natural ecosystems.",
        "realWorldExample": "A school excursion from Kumasi to the Akosombo Dam and Shai Hills is an example of domestic educational tourism."
