          "Cultural and Architectural Heritage: Manhyia Palace Museum in Kumasi, Larabanga Mosque (Ghana's oldest Sudanese mud-and-stick mosque in Savannah Region), Sirigu painted pottery village in Upper East, and traditional Ashanti architecture.",
