        "keyTakeaway": "Exam cheating results in paper cancellation and criminal imprisonment under the WAEC Law, destroying a student's academic future.",
        "realWorldExample": "WAEC canceling an entire school center's BECE results after invigilators were caught sending worked answers to students via WhatsApp."
